Well, what I suggested to TDT some years ago (and had rejected) was that
a wielded stack would be reported as (wielding one), with enchantments and
the like affecting them all.

The main downside is that corrosion and suchlike would unstack them, which
might cause pack overflow. However GOLDOBJ has added support for
non-alphabetic inventory characters, and I suggest that pack overflow
cases (like but not including this one) could simply use some
non-alphabetics; in that state you'd be unable to pick things up or do
other "backpack full" actions, but you wouldn't be compelled to drop
anything.
